-----BEGIN PLACEHOLDER-----
This repository does not ship real key material.

Run scripts/tls/generate_certs.sh to overwrite this file, device.crt and
ca.crt with a freshly generated CA and device certificate. The three files
are embedded into the firmware binary at build time (EMBED_TXTFILES in
main/CMakeLists.txt), so the firmware must be rebuilt afterwards.

They are only used by the mTLS and MQTTS baselines; the SRAFT protocol
itself does not depend on them.

Do not commit the generated files back into this repository.
-----END PLACEHOLDER-----
